  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.16 Jurisprudence Examination Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Registration in Optometry",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.16 Jurisprudence Examination Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Registration in Optometry. The fee for the jurisprudence examination for the profession regulated by the board of registration in optometry under RSA 327 shall be $69.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.14)",
